              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 20.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abavandimwe nibaba hamwe umwe agapfa adasize impfubyi y'umuhungu, umugore w'uwapfuye ntazashyingirwe ahandi hatari muri bene wabo b'umugabo we, ahubwo umugabo wabo amucyure, amuhungure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuhungu azabanza kubyara azabe ari we uzungurira se wabo wapfuye, kugira ngo izina rye ritazimira mu Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7+RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rusi 4.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwo mugabo nadakunda guhungura umugore wabo, uwo mugore ajye mu marembo y'umudugudu abwire abakuru ati “Umugabo wacu yanze gucikura mwene se, ntakunze kumpungura.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru b'umudugudu wabo bamuhamagaze bamuhane, nadakurwa ku ijambo akavuga ati “Sinshaka kumuhungura”, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umugore wabo amwegerere imbere y'abo bakuru amukweture inkweto, amucire mu maso avuge ati “Uko abe ari ko udacikura mwene se agirirwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izina rye rizahore rivugwa ritya mu Bisirayeli ngo “Inzu y'uwakwetuwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
